{"availability":"available","full":"PlatformRelay/Kollect","name":"Kollect","description":"Your cluster, in Git, diffable — Kubernetes inventory operator: CRD-native GVK selection, CEL extraction, export to Git, databases, and streams.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Go","stars":5,"forks":1,"created":"2026-06-04T23:26:43Z","updated":"2026-10-10T14:48:59Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://platformrelay.github.io/Kollect/","topics":["audit","cel","crd","gitops","golang","inventory","kubernetes","kubernetes-operator","operator"],"demo":"https://platformrelay.github.io/Kollect/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:15.250Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:15.250Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:15.250Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T15:06:15.250Z","stars":5,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Turn Kubernetes state into durable inventory. Declare what matters once. Kollect keeps it current and delivers it to Git, object storage, databases, and event streams. Select resources by GVK, extract the attributes you need with CEL or JSONPath, and every sink receives the same canonical rows in parallel.","Start with one sink. Grow to a whole platform. A single pipeline can write an inspectable Git history, a queryable database record, an object-store snapshot, or an event stream—without scripts or API-server hammering. As adoption grows, nothing gets rebuilt: the same rows fan out to more sinks, and KollectScope keeps it multi-tenant. Every team owns its inventory as configuration, not code, in its own namespace; consumers read export data, never unbounded list/watch against the live cluster.","Pre-1.0. Kollect uses a v1alpha1 API. Breaking API or default changes may ship in minor releases before 1.0; release notes and migration guidance call them out. See the roadmap for current maturity."],"features":["Decoupled read model — consumers query a sink, not the apiserver. No RBAC blast radius, no","Event-driven, no polling — one shared informer per GVK keeps inventory current as the cluster","Schema-flexible — declare the attributes you want in a KollectProfile; no bespoke collector","Pluggable sinks, no privileged backend — the same snapshot fans out to Git, Postgres, object","Multi-tenant by design — KollectScope gates which teams, namespaces, and sinks each tenant"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PlatformRelay/Kollect/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e4a48c9e78db45ed0a19e7aabc19c7b55566111d9da27a4e10137447ebde5633","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:15.401Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:15.401Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Turn Kubernetes state into durable inventory. Declare what matters once. Kollect keeps it current and delivers it to Git, object storage, databases, and event streams. Select resources by GVK, extract the attributes you need with CEL or JSONPath, and every sink receives the same canonical rows in parallel.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PlatformRelay/Kollect/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"e4a48c9e78db45ed0a19e7aabc19c7b55566111d9da27a4e10137447ebde5633","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PlatformRelay/Kollect/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:15.401Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T14:48:59Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PlatformRelay/Kollect/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:15.402Z","hash":"e4a48c9e78db45ed0a19e7aabc19c7b55566111d9da27a4e10137447ebde5633","originalBytes":13115,"storedBytes":13115,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["git","kollect","inventory","sink","kollectsnapshotsink","task","sinks","beta","docs","export","postgres","snapshot","gcs","inv","kafka","kollectdatabasesink","same","see","shared","api","architecture","code","contributing.md","core","gitlab","hub","kind","kollecteventsink","kubernetes","mongodb","one","per","performanc